{"title": "Thailand School Shooting Leaves at Least 8 Dead, Including Gunman", "summary": "A shooting at a school in Thailand resulted in at least 8 deaths, including the 14-year-old gunman who died by suicide. The victims included six students and two teachers. Police reported that the gunman had previously brought an air gun to school. The Associated Press reported that a 12-year-old girl died after the initial incident, raising the death toll. Relatives began claiming bodies of the deceased. The incident occurred near Bangkok.", "summary_points": ["A 14-year-old gunman killed at least 8 people, including himself, in a school shooting near Bangkok.", "The victims included six students and two teachers.", "Police stated the gunman had previously brought an air gun to school.", "A 12-year-old girl died after the shooting, increasing the death toll to at least 8.", "Relatives were seen claiming the bodies of those killed."], "title_hi": "थाईलैंड में स्कूल गोलीबारी में बंदूकधारी सहित कम से कम 8 की मौत", "summary_hi": "थाईलैंड के एक स्कूल में हुई गोलीबारी में आत्मघाती हमलावर सहित कम से कम 8 लोगों की मौत हो गई। पीड़ितों में छह छात्र और दो शिक्षक शामिल थे। पुलिस ने बताया कि बंदूकधारी पहले स्कूल में एक एयर गन लेकर आया था। एसोसिएटेड प्रेस ने बताया कि गोलीबारी के बाद एक 12 वर्षीय लड़की की मौत हो गई, जिससे मरने वालों की संख्या बढ़कर कम से कम 8 हो गई। रिश्तेदारों ने मृतकों के शवों का दावा करना शुरू कर दिया। यह घटना बैंकॉक के पास हुई।", "summary_points_hi": ["एक 14 वर्षीय बंदूकधारी ने बैंकॉक के पास एक स्कूल में खुद सहित कम से कम 8 लोगों की हत्या कर दी।", "पीड़ितों में छह छात्र और दो शिक्षक शामिल थे।", "पुलिस ने कहा कि बंदूकधारी पहले स्कूल में एक एयर गन लेकर आया था।", "गोलीबारी के बाद एक 12 वर्षीय लड़की की मौत हो गई, जिससे मरने वालों की संख्या बढ़कर कम से कम 8 हो गई।", "रिश्तेदार मारे गए लोगों के शवों का दावा करते देखे गए।"], "framing": {"center": ["Stated at least seven people died, including the gunman.", "Reported the gunman was a teenager.", "Noted police stated the teen had previously brought a BB gun to school."], "right": ["Focused on the gunman learning firearm use online.", "Mentioned the suspect had previously taken an air gun to school.", "Raised questions about Thailand's gun laws in relation to the shooting."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["बंदूकधारी सहित कम से कम सात लोगों की मौत की सूचना दी।", "बताया कि बंदूकधारी एक किशोर था।", "उल्लेख किया कि पुलिस ने कहा कि किशोर पहले स्कूल में एक बीबी गन लेकर आया था।"], "right": ["बंदूकधारी द्वारा ऑनलाइन हथियार का उपयोग सीखने पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया।", "उल्लेख किया कि संदिग्ध पहले स्कूल में एक एयर गन लेकर गया था।", "गोलीबारी के संबंध में थाईलैंड के बंदूक कानूनों पर सवाल उठाए।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/4df6b99d2c824220059f21f644937c28?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&cropH=2813&cropW=5000&xPos=0&yPos=260&width=862&height=485", "sources": [{"source": "CNN", "owner": "CNN", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNcTl1RTM3UTNIOHNUZmxFZExZVGFhOFlmQ05UenF6Q3J2VVdfalRXSW1INGt5b3BPUWduLUNUdmlrQWpfbkF3ZmVfT0ZKMS13eUxHeE12dDZrMWZhMG9uMEs0Q3lKOHR3TklXR2U0TDN2ekZzSjR6Z1lHZFM4TWdoR1RMTzFRcUJXOWF0LU0xMlRvVGpWbUk5YTlRZzFVQkJURGZBcmVSbUlrX09fdGc?oc=5", "headline": "Thai school teachers mourned after deadly shooting"}, {"source": "Sky News", "owner": "Sky News", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOTlM0TlhrdXh1MXg2WlRBYUVrYTdHakZFUGRTV0ctYjFQRDZQVXE5ajg0bUlsS0t4dVN4bDRXaTB0SVd4ODRQRlFOakliZTBkYVpTVk5KcFFFRnRGbVNYX0tYZDNPcGxmUUUxU0NiSVU4Vm85MUxCZzZqdzFQekpPbQ?oc=5", "headline": "Live from Bangkok school shooting scene"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Seven dead, including gunman, at Thailand school shooting"}, {"source": "Associated Press", "owner": "Associated Press", "lean": "internatio